  "description_short": "Laid-back Wilderness lounge bar serving pizza, cocktails and good vibes near the beach.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on Leila's Lane in Wilderness, Backline Lounge Bar brings a relaxed coastal atmosphere to the Garden Route. The vibe is casual and welcoming, perfect for unwinding after a day exploring the beaches and forests nearby. The menu centers around wood-fired pizzas with creative toppings, alongside a selection of burgers and sharing plates that pair well with their cocktail list.\n\nThe indoor-outdoor setup works beautifully for Wilderness's temperate climate, and the bar attracts both locals and visitors looking for something more low-key than formal dining. It's the kind of place where you can settle in for the evening, whether you're catching up with friends or simply enjoying a sundowner. The service is friendly without being fussy, and the pricing sits comfortably in the mid-range, making it an easy choice for a relaxed meal out.",
